  <activity label="u3_ct_muc3" xml:id="u3_ct_muc3" numbered="yes" adaptive="yes" indentation="hide" language="java">
    <statement>
      <p>
        Write a <c>withdraw</c> method for the <c>BankAccount</c> class. It takes an <c>int</c> <c>amount</c>. If the account has at least that much money, subtract <c>amount</c> from <c>balance</c>. Otherwise, leave <c>balance</c> unchanged.
        The blocks below are mixed up and include extra blocks that are not
        needed. Drag the needed blocks from the left and put them in order on
        the right, with the right indentation. Click Check to check your
        solution.
      </p>
    </statement>

